WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
TradeCatch demo: a missed call becomes an SMS conversation.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The customer shares name, address, and issue details by text.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:35.000
An on-call technician receives a job card and can accept by reply.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The customer is notified when a technician accepts the request.
